A mutation takes a saved `profiles` document as `snapshot`, including `_id` and `_creationTime`. The app uses Convex 1.44.0.

```ts
import { defineSchema, defineTable } from "convex/server";
import { v } from "convex/values";

export default defineSchema({
  profiles: defineTable({
    displayName: v.string(),
    bio: v.string(),
  }),
});
```

The mutation imports this schema as `schema` and uses `args: { snapshot: snapshotValidator }`.
